  "S2": {
   "id": "S2",
   "kind": "document",
   "title": "Statistics Reference Notes",
   "text": "INFERENCE\n95% confidence interval for a mean (sigma known): x-bar +/- 1.96 * sigma / sqrt(n)\nt statistic: t = (x-bar - mu0) / (s / sqrt(n)), with n - 1 degrees of freedom\nType I error rate = alpha. Power = 1 - beta.\nChi-square statistic: sum((observed - expected)^2 / expected)",
   "doc_id": "statistics_reference_notes",
